From d81fce80758f717ab59d311ad333455bc32cb8b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JoshuaHayesWasHere <josh.hayes121@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:32:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(web): jstack tree sidebar, fed by jbus

The sidebar draws a jstack project as one row merged with its root home,
its domain homes under it, and its worker tasks (scout, crew, review) as
quiet rows with stage ticks. The server watches jbus's state and streams
it over subscribeJbusWork. Settings > Labs switches the tree and its
options; it is on by default.

A local build's version carries +jstack build metadata, which keeps the
nightly channel.
